-- 7 U.S.C. 2014a: a certified household that no longer lives in the State where it is certified must report that.
-- SOURCE: usc07-ch51.txt (a converter's rendering, not the official text).
-- The section states no deadline ("in a manner prescribed by the Secretary"), so there is a decision function and no regulative rule with a clock.

-- src:489 | Beginning on May 5, 2017, in fiscal year 2017 and each fiscal year hereafter, notwithstanding any other provision of law, a household certified to participate in the Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program is required to report in a manner prescribed by the Secretary if the household no longer resides in the State in which it is certified.
@ref s 2014a (src:489)
GIVEN `the household is certified to participate in the Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the household no longer resides in the State in which it is certified` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2014a the household is required to report that it no longer resides in the State in which it is certified` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the household is certified to participate in the Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program`
            THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the requirement is on "a household certified to participate in the Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program"
        IF `the date` LESS THAN Date 5 5 2017
            THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the requirement begins "on May 5, 2017"
        IF `the household no longer resides in the State in which it is certified`
            THEN JUST TRUE  -- the text says yes: "a household certified to participate in the Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program is required to report in a manner prescribed by the Secretary if the household no longer resides in the State in which it is certified"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "is required to report ... if the household no longer resides in the State in which it is certified" (a failed "if", marginal reading (a))
